  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pip is a puppy. Pip is small. He is a good puppy. Pip likes to walk. Pip walks in the park. The park is green. The park is big. Pip sees a big house. This is a book house. The book house is nice. Pip likes this house. He walks to the door. The door is open. The book house is quiet.",
      "Pip likes quiet places. Pip sees many books. Books are on a table. Books are on a shelf. Books are red. Books are blue. Books are green. Pip sees a boy. The boy is happy. He reads a book. Pip sees a girl. She also reads. Books are good. Pip sits on the floor.",
      "This floor is clean. Pip looks at the books. A book is red. A book is yellow. Pip likes books. This place is good. The boy smiles at Pip. The girl smiles at Pip. Pip is happy. Pip is a happy puppy. This book house is fun. Reading is fun."
    ],
